,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Part 1 pushed for review as Gerrit change 2167: https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/2167 (Change-Id I6d265a1). Awaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 before Submit. Plan-review gate satisfied via a certified attestation (attested PASS, key_id present, verified_at_sha e48142648). Landing worktree: ../standalone-completion-record.","timestamp":1787538704864442001}],"created_at":1787535885664471001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"3cc60fb1-585d-48d7-994f-a56cc49d001f","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"c598-b5bb-ffbc-4d81"},{"link_uuid":"d5f5afac-a4e2-4700-b6c4-3b3b7b2f2e7d","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"d607-b835-89d9-4911"},{"link_uuid":"fbae0a6f-a2b5-449d-a8a6-eae02a64c591","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"6f09-4d06-a975-43b7"}],"description":"## Summary\n\nMake a completion-verifier run performed OUTSIDE a close transition RECORD its result on the\nticket, so a later close at the SAME `--ref` REUSES that certified PASS instead of firing a\nduplicate (billable) verifier run. This is the recording half that composes with the already\nimplemented close-time reuse (`close_autoresume._reusable_attested_pass`); it makes standalone\ncompletion verification symmetric with `review-plan` (which already signs its attestation and\nemits its sidecar).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] A new best-effort producer `transition_close.record_completion_verdict(result, ticket_id,\n      repo_root, *, sign=True)` emits the `COMPLETION_VERDICT` sidecar (PASS/FAIL) and, on an\n      attested, certifiable PASS pinned to a `verified_at_sha`, signs the reusable\n      `completion-verifier` op-cert via the shared producer `sign_completion_verdict`. It never\n      signs a `local`/uncertifiable/non-PASS verdict and never raises.\n- [x] `rebar verify-completion` records by default with a `--no-sign` opt-out (symmetric with\n      `review-plan`'s `--no-sign`); text output reports what was recorded. The committed CLI\n      help artifact is regenerated.\n- [x] The MCP `verify_completion` tool records unless the server is read-only; the outcome\n      rides on the result's `record` field.\n- [x] Tests prove a standalone attested PASS is signed and REUSED by a later same-ref close\n      (verifier provider never called), and that `--no-sign` / `local` source / `certifiable=\n      False` / FAIL each record correctly without signing.\n- [x] Targeted lint (ruff + C901 complexity ratchet), format, mypy, and the completion\n      reuse/close/facade/help suites pass.\n\n## Files\n\n- `src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py` — new `record_completion_verdict` helper.\n- `src/rebar/_cli/_llm_commands.py` — wire recording + `_render_record_line`.\n- `src/rebar/_cli/_parsers/advanced/llm.py` — `--no-sign` flag.\n- `src/rebar/_cli/help/verify-completion.txt` — regenerated help.\n- `src/rebar/_mcp_llm.py` — record on the MCP tool.\n- `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_standalone_completion_record.py` — new tests.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py","reason":"add record_completion_verdict producer helper"},{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/_llm_commands.py","reason":"wire standalone recording + render line"},{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/_parsers/advanced/llm.py","reason":"add --no-sign flag to verify-completion"},{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/help/verify-completion.txt","reason":"regenerated CLI help"},{"path":"src/rebar/_mcp_llm.py","reason":"record on MCP verify_completion unless read-only"},{"path":"tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_standalone_completion_record.py","reason":"new tests for standalone recording + reuse"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","6f09-4d06-a975-43b7"],["relates_to","c598-b5bb-ffbc-4d81"],["relates_to","d607-b835-89d9-4911"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"3c84eaf2-2824-49b5-9cb3-69ae58250d26","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["reuse","attestation","completion"],"ticket_id":"d123-178f-67fa-442b","ticket_type":"story","title":"Record standalone completion-verifier runs on the ticket for close-time reuse","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f4e5a487-24f0-4c0c-a5bf-956638da3268","894b46c2-110f-4f50-914a-8d3876e07709","cc779984-3e85-4d3f-aeb8-f1d8569a905f","3c84eaf2-2824-49b5-9cb3-69ae58250d26","5219692e-350a-449e-972b-5de099c988d1","5b6a67e7-089d-4922-9308-c8fe2d2421a8","3cc60fb1-585d-48d7-994f-a56cc49d001f","d5f5afac-a4e2-4700-b6c4-3b3b7b2f2e7d","fbae0a6f-a2b5-449d-a8a6-eae02a64c591"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787543119284731123,"uuid":"bd4c8c49-268c-40ff-9c11-01dfb4b2f419"}